Three commits this session — 61 total refactors. Summary:

**#58** — `api/plugins/utils/Utils.constSet`: collapsed `Collections.unmodifiableSet(new HashSet<>(Arrays.asList(arr)))` → `Set.of(arr)`, dropping 3 now-unused imports (`Arrays`, `HashSet`, `Collections`).

**#59** — `String.valueOf(int)` → `Integer.toString()` / `.toString()` at 4 sites (SourceLineFormatter, DotGraphUtils, FileUtils, ResXmlGen).

**#60** — `new LinkedList<>()` → `new ArrayList<>()` at 7 pure accumulator sites (no queue/deque ops). `LinkedList` import dropped from 3 files that had no other usages.

**#61** — 3 more `String.valueOf(int)` → `Integer.toString()` replacements (ClassCodeContentPanel, ADBDialog, DesktopEntryUtils).

